[{:adr/authoritative_for ["Witness admission への engi/L1 は permissionless staking にする: 一定量の外部担保\n    (EN自体ではない — net-zero・非発行の相互信用は外部価格保証がなく没収の実害が無いため)\n    をbondしたdid:keyは既存witnessの承認投票なしに次epochから自動的にwitness集合に\n    入る。bond資産はADR-2607101100 §4が既に文書化しているetzhayyimのUSDC on Base L2\n    境界を想定するが、実際のエスクローsmart contractは本ADRではデプロイしない(仕様のみ)。\n    engi.stakeは既に検証済みの{witness-did -> bonded-amount}mapを受け取るだけの疎結合設計" "quorumはwitness数ベースではなくstake加重にする: 投票したwitnessの合計bondが\n    witness集合全体の合計bondの2/3を超えるかで判定。Byzantine支配bondが全体の1/3未満なら\n    任意の2つの2/3quorumは1/3超の重なりを持ち正直なbondを含むという安全性論法\n    (Tendermint型stake-weighted BFTと同型)" "スラッシング対象はequivocationのみに限定する: 同一witness鍵が同一heightで異なる\n    block-hashに署名した2票という暗号学的に議論の余地なく確定する不正のみを対象にし、\n    全額bond没収(95% burn + 5% whistleblower reward、既定値・調整可能)。liveness障害\n    (沈黙・censorship)は誠実な障害と悪意を客観的に区別できないためスラッシング対象に\n    せず、次epochのACTIVE集合からの除外のみ(bond没収なし)。これによりADR-2607110300が\n    名指しした『slashing verdictへの異議申立て機構が無い』というギャップを、機構を\n    新設せず解消する(equivocationは主観的判断の余地が構造的に存在しないため)" "unbond-delay-epochs(既定3)を設け、unbond申請直後の証拠提出前資金引き揚げ\n    (逃げ得)を防ぐ。パラメータ(min-bond既定500・unbond-delay・liveness-window既定50\n    height・手数料率)は全てガバナンス調整可能な例示値で、変更は専用ガバナンス機構を\n    新設せずブロック確定と同じstake-weighted 2/3 quorum投票を再利用する" "witnessへの報酬はENの新規mintでは不可(non-minted不変条件に反する)ため、外部資産\n    (bond資産と同じUSDC等)建ての小額per-transfer手数料をbond比例で分配する外部\n    手数料モデルを採用する" "ブートストラップの限界を誠実に認める: Day1時点でbond witnessはcom-junkawasaki\n    1者のみ(実質的集中度は不変)。本ADRが変えるのは『witness #2以降の参加に\n    com-junkawasakiの許可が一切不要になる』という構造のみ。実在する独立第三者の\n    勧誘・契約はagentの実行範囲外でオーナー側の別事業活動 — witness-recruitment.md\n    は勧誘の材料文書であり配布はしない"], :adr/supersedes ["90-docs/adr/2607110300-kotoba-lang-net-kotobase-cloud-murakumo-decentralization-roadmap.md (Phase 4の「shape only、着手する場合は別ADR」をENGI/EN witness admissionに限定して具体化)"], :adr/superseded_by ["adr-2607995000-kotoba-three-sphere-economy (partial: Decision #7's per-EN-transfer external-asset fee is repealed — replaced by witness-duty credits minting + governance-gated external service payments; Decision #5's equivocation-only principle promoted to the zone-wide slashing rule)"], :adr/topic "engi-l1-permissionless-staking", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607993000-engi-l1-byzantine-consensus-en-currency.md" "90-docs/adr/2607110300-kotoba-lang-net-kotobase-cloud-murakumo-decentralization-roadmap.md" "90-docs/adr/2607101100-engi-mutual-credit-kotobase-native-design.md" "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/engi/blob/main/src/engi/stake.cljc" "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/engi/blob/main/docs/witness-recruitment.md"], :adr/status "accepted (design + cljc prototype; no real external-collateral escrow contract deployed)", :adr/id "adr-2607994000-engi-l1-permissionless-staking-equivocation-slashing", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-15", :adr/decision "{:bond-asset \"external collateral (USDC on Base L2 assumed, reusing ADR-2607101100 §4's existing off-ramp boundary), NOT EN itself\", :admission \"permissionless: bond >= min-bond, no existing-witness vote\", :quorum \"stake-weighted >2/3 of total bonded stake among epoch witness set, not witness head-count\", :epoch \"witness set + stake snapshotted at epoch boundaries\", :slashing {:scope \"equivocation only (two signed votes, same witness key, same height, different block-hash)\", :penalty \"full bond: 95% burn + 5% whistleblower reward (illustrative)\", :not-slashed \"liveness/censorship faults -- dropped from next epoch's active set only, no bond forfeiture\"}, :unbond-delay-epochs 3, :illustrative-params {:min-bond 500, :liveness-window-heights 50}, :reward-model \"external per-finalized-transfer fee (same asset as bond), distributed pro-rata by stake -- NOT new EN minting\", :governance \"same stake-weighted 2/3 quorum vote used for finality, no separate governance system\", :bootstrap-honesty \"day 1: n=1 (com-junkawasaki only), practically unchanged concentration; what changes is the protocol no longer requires com-junkawasaki's permission for witness #2+ to join\", :out-of-scope [\"real Base L2 escrow contract deployment\" \"recruiting/contracting actual third-party operators (business development, not agent-executable)\" \"liveness/censorship dispute adjudication (deliberately sidestepped by not slashing those faults)\"]}", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607994000: engi/L1 witness admission — permissionless staking(Base L2 USDC 想定)+ equivocation限定スラッシング(ADR-2607110300 Phase 4 の具体化)"}]
